---

<Base title="About" description="About Ismael Balafrej — ML researcher and engineer in Montreal.">
  <article class="about-page">
    <header class="about-header">
      <h1>About</h1>
    </header>

    <div class="about-body">
      <aside class="about-side">
        <img src="/profile.jpg" alt="" class="about-avatar" />
        <ul class="side-links">
          {links.map(l => (
            <li>
              <a
                href={l.href}
                {...(l.external ? { target: '_blank', rel: 'noopener noreferrer' } : {})}
              >
                <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" set:html={l.svg} />
                <span>{l.label}</span>
              </a>
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>
      </aside>

      <div class="prose about-prose">
        <p>
          Hi, I'm Ismael. I'm an ML researcher and engineer based in Montreal. My work spans both ends of the compute spectrum: efficient models on constrained edge hardware and training at scale.
        </p>
        <p>
          I write about things I find interesting: spiking neural networks, edge inference, machine learning, and data science. The blog is where I think out loud.
        </p>
        <p>
          Feel free to reach out via my <a href="mailto:ecology-dad-cyclic@duck.com">current alias email</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</Base>

<style>
  .about-page {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin-inline: auto;
    padding: var(--space-2xl) var(--space-md) var(--space-3xl);
  }

  .about-header {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2xl);
  }

  .about-header h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: var(--text-3xl);
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .about-body {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 180px minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: var(--space-2xl);
    align-items: start;
  }

  .about-side {
    position: sticky;
    top: var(--space-md);
  }

  .about-avatar {
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    object-fit: cover;
    border-radius: 2px;
    display: block;
    filter: saturate(0.85);
  }

  .side-links {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: var(--space-md) 0 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-2xs);
  }

  .side-links a {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-2xs);
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: var(--color-ink-2);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color var(--dur-fast) var(--ease-out);
  }
  .side-links a:hover {
    color: var(--color-accent);
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .side-links svg {
    color: var(--color-ink-3);
    flex-shrink: 0;
    transition: color var(--dur-fast) var(--ease-out);
  }
  .side-links a:hover svg { color: var(--color-accent); }

  .about-prose > p:first-child {
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
    color: var(--color-ink);
    line-height: 1.5;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .about-body {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
      gap: var(--space-xl);
    }
    .about-side {
      position: static;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 96px minmax(0, 1fr);
      gap: var(--space-md);
      align-items: start;
    }
    .side-links { margin-top: 0; }
  }
</style>
